{"id":"e_motion","lemma":"émotion","pos":"noun","rank":1990,"glosses":["emotion"],"ipa":"/e.mo.sjɔ̃/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/e/e6/Fr-%C3%A9motion.ogg/Fr-%C3%A9motion.ogg.mp3","gender":"f","forms":{"plural":"émotions"},"formAudio":{"émotions":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/d/d4/LL-Q150_%28fra%29-LightD31-%C3%A9motions.wav"},"examples":[{"text":"Ne montre pas tes émotions.","en":"Don't let your feelings show.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/2331","words":[{"g":"not"},{"g":"watch, wristwatch"},{"g":"not"},{"g":"your"},null]},{"text":"La colère est une émotion.","en":"Anger is an emotion.","words":[{"g":"the / her"},{"g":"anger, rage"},{"g":"is","l":"être"},{"g":"a"},null]},{"text":"Elle ne peut réprimer ses émotions.","en":"She can't suppress her emotions.","words":[{"g":"she / it"},{"g":"not"},{"g":"can, to be able to","l":"pouvoir"},{"g":"to suppress, quell"},{"g":"his"},null]},{"text":"Il montra des signes de grande émotion.","en":"He showed signs of great emotion.","words":[{"g":"he / it"},{"g":"to show","l":"montrer"},{"g":"some / of the","l":"un"},{"g":"sign (indicator","l":"signe"},{"g":"of / from"},{"g":"big","l":"grand"},null]},{"text":"Elle ne sait pas gérer ses émotions.","en":"She can't control her emotions.","words":[{"g":"she / it"},{"g":"not"},{"g":"to know","l":"savoir"},{"g":"not"},{"g":"to manage"},{"g":"his"},null]}]}